text = "                                      Story



     You were having fun dancing at a saloon in the wild west. 
     Unfortunately while dancing you step on the foot of an outlaw. 
     Since he is a nice guy and wants you to get better at dancing, 
     he shoots at your feet in rythm to the music. 
     And promises that he will continue until the next night.
     

     Dodge the bullets for 36 rounds to win."

